      "proposed_new": {
        "source": "docs/technical-design.md",
        "section": "3.9",
        "line": 225,
        "text": "- `task_manage` 是统一的状态变更工具，使用判别联合支持 `create/append/pause/cancel/complete`，不拆成多个工具；不向模型暴露独立的 `resume` 操作。",
        "sha256": "b6f260c2033cfaa3d61307b244e293098fc9d9371db70a692acc6377d17dbf10"
      },
      "status": "awaiting_coordinator_reseal",
