  "new_unassigned_current_blocks": [
    {
      "section": "3.6",
      "line": 176,
      "text": "- Task 在创建时固定 `completion_policy=once|ongoing`；Main 可在 `task_manage(create)` 显式提供 `completionPolicy`，省略保持 `once`。",
      "sha256": "9b76657864eec531586f9299cc2aa057ba92335bebdcb59ceb90cdde0b35f899"
    },
    {
      "section": "3.9",
      "line": 229,
      "text": "- `task_manage(create).completionPolicy` 只允许 `once|ongoing`，省略等同 `once`；仅 create 接受此字段。普通 Root 成功不结束 ongoing Task，也不自动调度下一轮；后续 append 沿用同一策略并按既有规则创建新 Root。策略创建后不可改写。ERII-225 的批准、升级边界与显式完成合同见 `docs/adr/006-explicit-task-completion-policy.md`。",
      "sha256": "4730d84bfe29f6484a55a382f741c485753e2f9354f875cc229a5af0c28af5d8"
    },
    {
      "section": "3.9",
      "line": 230,
      "text": "- `task_manage(complete)` 仅接受 `active` Task，且当前 epoch 没有非终态 Root/Child Run，也没有 queued/running/waiting/unknown ToolInvocation。存在未完成工作或未确认副作用、或 Task 为 paused/completed/cancelled 时返回不可重试的 `INVALID_ARGUMENT`，不取消、不排空、不等待。Host 在同一事务内校验 Main owner、Task version/epoch，保存 `completed`、`completed_at` 和普通幂等 receipt；不递增 epoch、不修改 completion policy、不生成 Worker TaskUpdate 或 Main Follow-up。重复来源/调用复用原 receipt；新的 complete 来源不能再次完成 completed Task。后续 append 沿既有规则重新激活并创建新 Root。",
      "sha256": "26ce7958d254d10732e6de6da9199c97dc6ce7d940870980e2d307bde5a6e630"
    }
  ],
  "limits": "Relocation and proposed old/new mapping only. No changed-block obligation inferred. No reseal, expanded assignment, release certification or completed package acceptance.",
